Changes: local extraction of the selected 1D pure-diffusion mathematics;
explicit NumPy ImageJ-equivalent sampling; NPZ interfaces; standalone Judge;
tests, documentation and active scientific review notebook. Exact upstream
revision and source locations are documented in test/validation.md.

ImageJ 1.54f sampling and downsampling routines are public domain, by
Wayne Rasband and contributors; downsampling algorithm by Michael Schmid.
Only explicit mathematical formulas are adapted; no ImageJ code is imported
or needed by the cleaned runtime.
